    list [expr {[llength [hir::diagnostics $hir]] > 0}] [hir::warnings::of $hir]
} -result {1 {}}

test mb-policy-is-per-compilation {interleaved compilations under different modes never leak a mode} -body {
    set a [compileWith $::mbSource off]
